            "document_name": "people-handbook.md",
            "chunk_id": 254,
            "chunk_index": 1,
            "content": "about balance corrections. This paragraph defines the annual leave rule; it does not define contractor benefits.\n\n## Probation\nNew employees have a three-month probation period. A manager schedules a review meeting during the final two weeks and records the outcome in the staff portal. An extension requires written approval from the People team. The review considers role expectations and documented feedback, rather than a single test score. The three-month period applies to new employees in this handbook."
          }
        ],
