            "document_id": "812829c8-aa84-4f8c-9b96-dd3414ec03fa",
            "document_name": "operations-runbook.md",
            "chunk_id": 262,
            "chunk_index": 1,
            "content": "because a container rollback alone may not restore schema compatibility. The on-call lead confirms service recovery.\n\n## On-call handoff\nThe primary on-call engineer hands off at 09:00 every Monday. The handoff note lists open incidents, risky changes and dashboard links. The secondary engineer acknowledges the handoff within one hour. If the primary cannot respond, the secondary becomes incident commander until a lead assigns a replacement. The note should not include credentials."
          }
        ],
